{"4793530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Remains on the bus", "steam_appid": 4793530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a remote town, there was a bus driver. He drove a bus from one stop to another, sold tickets, took money, and gave change. Then they came - shapeshifters. They were almost like regular people, but there was always something off about them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4793530/extras/730519d7b8102711e30d83ec79413fc9.poster.avif?t=1788264005\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4793530/extras/730519d7b8102711e30d83ec79413fc9.webm?t=1788264005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4793530/extras/730519d7b8102711e30d83ec79413fc9.mp4?t=1788264005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some had weird skin, some didn't know the basics of this world, and some wouldn't even answer a single question. But not everyone is easy to spot. Some are extremely convincing. You have a set of tools to test them before they can take a ride on your bus. You can X-ray them, ask questions, measure their temperature, and run many other tests. If a shapeshifter hops on the bus, they can slotter the regular passenger. Nobody wants that, so pay attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4793530/extras/a30b636eca1fbcd66bc54f35cd2fabb4.poster.avif?t=1788264005\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4793530/extras/a30b636eca1fbcd66bc54f35cd2fabb4.webm?t=1788264005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4793530/extras/a30b636eca1fbcd66bc54f35cd2fabb4.mp4?t=1788264005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measure temperature with a thermometer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at the body with an X-ray light</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask the passenger about they apperance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide whether you should give a ticket or not</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive passengers to stops where they want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to get new buses and upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4793530/extras/92cea5a04360659d986e7319c8b1d13b.poster.avif?t=1788264005\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4793530/extras/92cea5a04360659d986e7319c8b1d13b.webm?t=1788264005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4793530/extras/92cea5a04360659d986e7319c8b1d13b.mp4?t=1788264005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a remote town, there was a bus driver. He drove a bus from one stop to another, sold tickets, took money, and gave change. Then they came - shapeshifters. They were almost like regular people, but there was always something off about them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa